WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.839
Hi there! ResDish helps restaurants in the United States and Canada turn surplus food into revenue, in under a minute.

00:00:07.142 --> 00:00:09.019
Log in to your restaurant dashboard.

00:00:12.931 --> 00:00:16.302
It shows your pickups, offers, menu, orders, and payouts.

00:00:16.705 --> 00:00:22.188
To post surplus food, pick a dish from your menu, say why it's available, and choose your discount.

00:00:22.488 --> 00:00:25.368
Set how many are available, and a discard timer.

00:00:27.447 --> 00:00:30.583
Your offer goes live for nearby customers right away.

00:00:33.041 --> 00:00:37.116
When a customer orders, a bell rings, and the order pops up on your screen.

00:00:38.093 --> 00:00:40.674
At pickup, type the customer's four-digit PIN.

00:00:41.461 --> 00:00:47.968
Check the order and hand over the food. The customer's card is charged, and your share is paid to your Stripe account.

00:00:48.747 --> 00:00:55.979
The Payouts tab lists every payment, in US or Canadian dollars, with its invoice number and transaction ID.

00:00:56.811 --> 00:01:04.000
And the daily report shows your sales, including any ResDish coupons, with print, PDF, and CSV downloads.

00:01:05.815 --> 00:01:09.420
That's ResDish. Less waste, and more revenue. Happy selling!
